{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9000_situation", "source_sha256": "3797778143ea5c497715b43bb9b5ffc7d19200ee6ece1f38aba054e85049aa7a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　休憩中", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9000_place", "source_sha256": "b378c18c3b6d6384d3fb0174a558a54e20ef16ab4d77e6be9fc7c68534797ea8", "ja": "控室", "zh": "休息室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9001_p", "source_sha256": "34b5c41f2050f09c8a0f95426213c9c6e92060a31bbc9e43cfdf8005f850efe1", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影が進む。\n紗代子のテーマは『HIP HOPレディ』だが……）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄正在进行中。\n纱代子的主题虽然是“HIP HOP淑女”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9002_027say", "source_sha256": "3854aded462763be1e978fd5c3c88dc61ad58d14e4c8ea447c1019377d20f8a0", "ja": "今日のために、クラブに行ってみたかったんです。\nけど、私の年齢じゃ難しくて……。", "zh": "为了今天，我本来想去俱乐部看看的。  \n可是，以我的年龄来说，实在有点困难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9003_027say", "source_sha256": "2d18bb92c72c4400f0ea987d891c7d24cc3b5aa144e4d21e963187f5befcde72", "ja": "莉緒さんたちに教えてもらって、私なりにイメージを\n膨らませてみたんです。……どうですか？", "zh": "莉绪姐她们教了我一些，然后我也按照自己的方式展开了想象。……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9004_p", "source_sha256": "c63a591dce21e9dea4249f64dfb4a43ab6d7fe5635e8193e0682a14e8f41c34a", "ja": "いい感じだと思うよ！　実際、紗代子みたいな人が\nクラブにいても違和感はないんじゃないかな。", "zh": "我觉得很不错！实际上，就算有紗代子这样的人在俱乐部里，应该也不会让人觉得违和。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9005_027say", "source_sha256": "5837ca2a8e6866493d829669abb0753a7a74c3b5bd9ae01968b67cf3f83930af", "ja": "本当ですか！？　でも、できる限りのことはしたいので\n改善できそうなことがあれば教えてください！", "zh": "真的吗！？不过，我想尽可能做好能做的事，\n如果有什么可以改进的地方，请告诉我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9006_p", "source_sha256": "6700893f5d925b00a9db1f5dc4e231c86d5702b5d5f0dd662d704f895888fb37", "ja": "改善できそうなことか……。そうだな。", "zh": "能改善的地方啊……嗯，让我想想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9007", "source_sha256": "5b351465d3074af30ffd2613dc40e7af3b3be7bbb81c4abb23bf7bbbb919c5e0", "ja": "もっと挑発的に", "zh": "再更具挑衅性一些", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9008", "source_sha256": "4f3d10782dfa71d53c5e8d2ec2a2756a2f439f7dac731eadfef22d259311c54d", "ja": "押しが足りない", "zh": "推荐力度不够", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9200_p", "source_sha256": "f741c3b717e1394b28aae5c5a8fb3fa8b3adfe6f06306311f599cd1157020bcc", "ja": "もっと挑発的でもいいんじゃないか？　危険な雰囲気が\n漂ってると、よりカッコよく見えると思うんだ。", "zh": "再挑衅一点也可以吧？要是能透出些危险的氛围，\n我觉得看起来会更帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9201_027say", "source_sha256": "407d0310270c90d5918dccdfecbc542f0ea344412a26c9f974b8939cb9198b85", "ja": "危険な雰囲気……！　確かにクラブにいる人達は、\n刺激的でカッコいいイメージがありますよね。", "zh": "危险的氛围……！确实，俱乐部里的人总给人一种刺激又帅气的印象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9202_027say", "source_sha256": "dd95212101c3ce85fc0e728337a6298741f8066e7412c5f6da69cca380e1c999", "ja": "悪そうだから、逆に惹かれちゃうというか……。\nわかりました！　思いきり大胆にやってみますね！", "zh": "因为看起来很坏，反而让人不由得被吸引……该说是这样吧。\n我明白了！那我就放开手脚大胆试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9300_p", "source_sha256": "f741c3b717e1394b28aae5c5a8fb3fa8b3adfe6f06306311f599cd1157020bcc", "ja": "もっと挑発的でもいいんじゃないか？　危険な雰囲気が\n漂ってると、よりカッコよく見えると思うんだ。", "zh": "再挑衅一点也可以吧？要是能透出些危险的氛围，\n我觉得看起来会更帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9301_027say", "source_sha256": "2e1830a980dfc1e0a36a99996e9bd570ab37a0021796ffbaac6dd66ca3238920", "ja": "あっ！　やっぱり、莉緒さんたちの言ったとおりなん\nですね……。大胆でセクシーなのが一番だって。", "zh": "啊！果然就像莉绪小姐她们说的那样……大胆又性感才是最棒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9302_027say", "source_sha256": "1bfdf6ba9740c5de43003887711f2df5ae974c4339a642cb7b88a8dcc1a83d8a", "ja": "イメージしたカッコよさから、少し離れますけど……\n{$P$}が言うなら、やってみます！", "zh": "虽然和我想象中的帅气形象有点不一样……但既然{$P$}这么说，我就试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9500_p", "source_sha256": "386cc42df37e911bd8b3181817ea4db364250d6586fa7fe3b8fa21e341a18aec", "ja": "押しが足りないのかもしれないな。大胆不敵なラッパー\nなら、誰が相手でも仕掛けていくはずだから……。", "zh": "可能是气势还不够吧。如果是那种无所畏惧的说唱歌手，\n无论对手是谁应该都会主动出击才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9501_027say", "source_sha256": "1dd62d78fafb4e68eb4f2b4f6d06eb8274949f507c9e3374bce3a51dd0dd5bd4", "ja": "押し……積極性ってことですね！　言われてみれば、\n物怖じしない強さが足りなかったかもしれません。", "zh": "所谓的主动出击……就是积极性吧！经你这么一说，或许我确实缺少了那种不畏惧的坚强。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9502_027say", "source_sha256": "07e50204f51689e72bea724116802cba98224e33cac16f8492c47e67d8b7fdcc", "ja": "今の私はラッパー……弱腰になったら負けですから！\nアドバイス、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "现在的我是说唱歌手……一旦畏缩就输了！谢谢你的建议♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9600_p", "source_sha256": "386cc42df37e911bd8b3181817ea4db364250d6586fa7fe3b8fa21e341a18aec", "ja": "押しが足りないのかもしれないな。大胆不敵なラッパー\nなら、誰が相手でも仕掛けていくはずだから……。", "zh": "可能是气势还不够吧。如果是那种无所畏惧的说唱歌手，\n无论对手是谁应该都会主动出击才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9601_027say", "source_sha256": "12c23d78f9912f6a5871a95ad287c2b5854ec75c179f966d570f121ab5d4b4fe", "ja": "ハッ！　確かに……。ううっ、\n大胆不敵のイメージが曖昧だったかもしれません。", "zh": "哈！确实……唔，看来我对“大胆无畏”的印象可能有些模糊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_9602_027say", "source_sha256": "c526fe895b11ab22b2120704b7b8a48c8f178363a49cbc610a3ce8b281bd631e", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}！\nもう少しだけ練習につき合ってもらえませんか？", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生！能再陪我练习一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
